  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "33-66",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> FAQ </h1>",
      "body": "<p>Frequently Asked Questions</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c1581",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "What are the main functions of the »titan« measuring machine?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »titan« enables high-precision measurement and inspection of a wide variety of cutting tools and workpieces. It combines state-of-the-art sensor technology and optical systems for exact measurement.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1578",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What is the measuring accuracy of the »titan«?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »titan«'s« measuring accuracy lies in the micrometer range, enabling extremely precise results: E<sub>xy</sub> = 2.0 μm + (L/250 mm) μm and E<sub>x</sub> = 1.3 μm + (L/300 mm) μm.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1576",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What types of tools can be measured using the »Titan«?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »Titan« can measure a wide variety of tools, such as milling cutters, drill bits, threading tools, gear-cutting tools, and many more.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1574",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What software is used for control and evaluation?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The device is operated by the powerful ZOLLER »pilot 4.0« software, which offers intuitive operation and comprehensive evaluation capabilities. Additionally, there are additional software options tailored to each specific application.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1572",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How many CNC-controlled axes does the device have?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »Titan« features 6 CNC-controlled axes, which enable flexible and precise positioning of the workpiece. A 7th axis is available as an optional addition.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1570",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What sensors and cameras are built into the »titan«?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »Titan« is equipped with two high-definition cameras and a sensor for measuring the preparation of the cutting edges, ensuring exact measurements.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1568",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How simple is the »titan« operation for users?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Thanks to its user-friendly software (including the ZOLLER measuring program assistant »«elephant»«) and ergonomic design, the operation of »the« »titan« is very simple and intuitive.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1566",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What are the benefits of automatic level control?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Automatic level adjustment ensures that the measuring machine is always optimally aligned, which improves measuring accuracy.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1564",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How is the quality of the measurement results ensured?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The quality of the measurement results is ensured through regular calibration, high-quality components, and precise software. ZOLLER is an Accredited calibration laboratory in accordance with DIN EN ISO/IEC 17025:2018.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1562",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What optional accessories are available for the »Titan«?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Various accessories are available for the »titan«, including additional clamping systems, software modules, and specific measurement adapters.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1560",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c1580",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
